#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/ledger.html:12
msgid ""
"The posted entries account by account. Balances are debit minus credit."
msgstr "Kirjatut kirjaukset tileittäin. Saldo on debet miinus kredit."

#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/ledger.html:19
msgid "Balance"
msgstr "Saldo"

#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/ledger.html:22
msgid "Balance brought forward"
msgstr "Alkusaldo"

#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/ledger.html:34
msgid "Total and balance"
msgstr "Yhteensä ja saldo"

#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/series_form.html:3
#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/series_form.html:5
msgid "Edit voucher series"
msgstr "Muokkaa tositesarjaa"

#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/trial_balance.html:12
msgid ""
"Every account's balance at the start and end of the period, and the period's"
" debits and credits. Balances are debit minus credit; they add up to zero."
msgstr ""
"Kunkin tilin saldo jakson alussa ja lopussa sekä jakson debetit ja kreditit."
" Saldo on debet miinus kredit; saldojen summa on nolla."

#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/trial_balance.html:18
msgid "At the start"
msgstr "Alussa"

#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/trial_balance.html:19
msgid "At the end"
msgstr "Lopussa"

#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_confirm_delete.html:3
